{"seq":3,"slug":"measurement","title":"度量与改进","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/measurement","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"onboarding-metrics-ttv","title":"入职度量与 Time-to-Value","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/measurement/onboarding-metrics-ttv","wordCount":1536,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"feedback-iteration","title":"反馈收集与迭代","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/measurement/feedback-iteration","wordCount":1600,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"remote-onboarding","title":"远程入职实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-onboarding-enablement/measurement/remote-onboarding","wordCount":1729,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"度量与改进\">度量与改进</h1><p>入职项目最常见的失败模式不是设计得不好，而是从不衡量效果、从不迭代。本章聚焦三个关键问题：如何量化入职成效（定义 Time-to-Value 并追踪先行/滞后指标）、如何系统收集反馈并将其转化为流程改进（避免入职计划变成一次性文档）、以及远程入职这一特殊场景的度量与实践差异。</p>\n<p>三篇文档形成闭环：指标体系告诉你「在看什么」，反馈迭代告诉你「怎么改」，远程入职则是前两者在分布式场景下的特殊适配。</p>\n"}